# Nutan Plastic Manufacturing Analytics

A data analytics project that analyzes plastic manufacturing data to understand production, quality, machine performance, defects, and downtime.

## Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- MySQL
- Power BI

## Key Analysis
- Production performance
- Machine efficiency
- Product analysis
- Shift performance
- Defect and rejection analysis
- Quality analysis
- Monthly production trends

## Project Goal
To analyze manufacturing data and create meaningful insights for better production and quality decisions.